  "description": "Situated on the south side of the Llyn Peninsula, Hafan Pwllheli is one of the finest yachting venues in Western Britain with access to some of the best sailing waters in the UK. The area is renowned for its varied pattern of winds, moderate tidal and sea conditions, and the spectacular scenery of the Snowdonian mountains as a backdrop. This rugged coastline has been designated an 'Area of Outstanding National Beauty'.",
